From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:37:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: wireless: qcom,ath12k: let the qcom,no-sbs
 description parse

The description of qcom,no-sbs is a plain YAML scalar with ": " inside,
which YAML reads as a mapping: the whole binding does not parse (yaml
"mapping values are not allowed here", line 41), so dt_binding_check
fails on it. Reword without the colon.

Fixes: a63f34cf66ce ("dt-bindings: net: wireless: qcom,ath12k: add qcom,no-sbs")
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml
index 37c431772c9c..a15af133f804 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/wireless/qcom,ath12k.yaml
@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@ properties:
     type: boolean
     description:
       The board cannot run the two radios of the chip in the two halves of
-      the 5 GHz band at the same time (single band simultaneous, SBS): the
+      the 5 GHz band at the same time (single band simultaneous, SBS), as the
       second radio has no 5 GHz path. The firmware must be told not to use it.
 
   vddaon-supply:
